# recursive interpolation not allowed

Tawm sau-ntawv: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Kev-pab-cuam-khoos-phis-tawj yam-ntxwv: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), kab-tshiab.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Tawm sau-ntawv: a, kab-tshiab.


Kev-pab-cuam-khoos-phis-tawj yam-ntxwv: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] qhib: Tseeb.

